// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - HABASHY1VARS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P337582898" "Man, as if we didn't have enough problems with Galaxy City, the <color red>Hellions</color> are terrorizing a neighborhood nearby!<br><br>The majority of the <color SkyBlue>Paragon Police Department</color> are too busy trying to contain the situation in Galaxy, and we've got a ton of refugees in that area trying to take shelter.<br><br>We need your help in taking back that neighborhood, {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P718894000" "Just tell me where to go and I'll help those people."
// SendOffString :
"P2110563442" "They're in... ah... one of the...<br><br><color orange>Matthew Habashy seems distracted for a moment. He shakes his head, gathering himself.</color><br><br>Sorry, they're in a neighborhood to the west of Atlas Plaza. You've got to thin out their numbers, then what remains of the <color SkyBlue>PPD</color> can take control of the situation.<br><br>Be careful, {HeroName}. The Hellions aren't your run of the mill gangsters. These guys are <color red>demon worshippers</color>!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2827606038" "Take the fight to the Hellions!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P373877551" "The PPD can swing in once you've given them some breathing room with the Hellions!"
// TaskTitle :
"P585749243" "<color deepskyblue>What Was Lost</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3073403113" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Demons and Gangsters</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
