// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P489298262" "Thanks, {HeroName}. The PPD are on the scene now and handling the situation.<br><br>The Hellions said something about Atlas Park being next to fall? <i>Seriously</i>? Can't we catch a break?<br><br>If it's not meteors destroying the city, it's a group of demon worshipping punk cultists saying the end is nigh.<br><br>Looks like we're not out of the woods yet..."

