// Dialog :
"P6775501" "Great work, {HeroName}.<br><br>You found information about something called the Ritual of Souls? That... doesn't sound good at all. But at least we know <i>where</i> they're going to be performing this ritual.<br><br>What worries me is <i>who</i> exactly gave this ritual to the Hellions. We can worry about that later, however, we have some more pressing matters to deal with...!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P66670920" "Is anyone there? Please, I don't have much time, they're going to find me at any moment!<br><br>I'm here with other survivors, please, someone needs to hear this!"
// Answer Text :
"P2767016200" "I'm here, my name is {HeroName}. Who is this?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2370264761" "{HeroName}! Oh, it's so good to hear someone else! My name is <color yellow>Dana Habashy</color>!"
// Answer Text :
"P1916814037" "Dana Habashy? Matthew's wife?"
// Page Wife Text :
"P3912543597" "<i>Matthew</i>? He's <i>safe</i>? He got out of Galaxy City?"
// Answer Text :
"P3008559048" "He is, hold on, let me get him on the communicator!"
// Page Communicator Text :
"P2742241828" "<color orange>You get your communicator and radio in Matthew Habashy.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2942583744" "(Listen)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Habashy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2638832922" "Well... we saved the day, {HeroName}. Those people you saved will be safe, and the Hellions' plan is stopped.<br><br>I just wish... that there was some answer for my wife, that we knew where she was!<br><br>If only I was able to go back and find her, none of this would've happened in the first place, she'd be safe!"
// Answer Text :
"P2945663868" "Your wife's alive, Matthew. It's not too late to save her."
// Page NotTooLate Text :
"P526037906" "You're right. I still have a chance. Not everyone can say that, right?<br><br>But we also need to make sure Atlas is safe. I'll work on my end to see what I can find regarding Arachnos: what they're doing, what they're planning, and where they're holding my wife and the other prisoners.<br><br>I know some people who could use your help right now. They're fighting the good fight in Atlas, but they're... well, they're losing."
// Answer Text :
"P3648694180" "Who are these people?"
// Answer Text :
"P3808020526" "I'll do what I can to help them, don't worry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4094813808" "There's no time to lose, {HeroName}. We know where the Hellions are preparing this Ritual of Souls. You need to get in there and put a stop to them, once and for all.<br><br><color yellow>The most important thing is to stop that ritual and rescue the citizens who were kidnapped.</color> There's one other thing I'd like you to look into."
// AcceptString :
"P3733956995" "What is it?"
// SendOffString :
"P489451111" "I'd like you to see if you can find out <color yellow>who gave them the ritual.</color> If someone's supplying the Hellions with something this dangerous, who knows who <i>else</i> they could be helping.<br><br>That's all assuming you can stop the ritual. If not, well, we'll have bigger problems on our hands than who is giving these guys rituals!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1850325952" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Is Now Found</color>"

