"P2136268806" "Hello? *Chhhhhhh*<em>Can anyone hear this? Hello?! Please, someone!"
// SaysList :
"P2733244981" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Violet>Matthew, is it really you? <t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>Dana... you're alive?! You're -alive-!<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Violet>Matthew, I don't have much time to talk, I'm being held prisoner by Arachnos...! <t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>What?! Where? I... we're coming to get you! <t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Violet> You and {HeroName} need to hear this! Arachnos has captured survivors of Galaxy City, and they're funding gangs in Atlas Park to destabilize it! They're the ones who helped the Hellions! <t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Violet>You need to stop them, or else -  <t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>*BAM!* <t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>*BAM!* <t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>*BAM!* <t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Violet> Matthew, I -  <t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson> There she is! Take her back in! <t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>Dana...! I'm... we're going to find you, I promise!"

